  "python_conversion_notes": "Requires reimplementation of XPeriodCandleSystem custom indicator logic in Python. The indicator aggregates price data into variable-period candles and determines direction via color assignment. The Tm_Plus variant shifts the candle timing by configurable offset. Without the source of these custom indicators, exact replication requires reverse-engineering the indicator algorithm from its name and behavior. MA crossover and RSI filters are standard and easily convertible. Time-shift logic adds complexity for session-aware entry filtering. New bar detection is essential and must be implemented. Position management follows standard pattern: close opposite, then open new.",
